        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "In the future when the need arises to fill a General Fitter/Technician/Field Operator positions, incumbent General Fitters/Technicians will be given the opportunity to upgrade to General Field Operator prior to the position being filled by advance assignment. However, only one (1) upgrade will be allowed per position prior to the position being filled by advanced assignment.",
